{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📱 範例 5：LINE 整合 AI 智慧客服助理\n\n1. **Webhook 觸發器**：接收使用者傳送的 LINE 訊息，並即時回覆 200 OK。\n2. **Code 節點**：精準解析 `replyToken`、`userId` 與 `userMessage`。\n3. **AI Agent**：串接 LLM 模型，並利用 `userId` 隔離 Window Buffer Memory。\n4. **HTTP Request**：呼叫 LINE Reply API 免費回傳 AI 產生的智慧回答。",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 440
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -16,
        -336
      ],
      "id": "d599e3aa-3c62-408e-a785-9510c4a816ec",
      "name": "流程說明"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "line-ai-webhook",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        128,
        96
      ],
      "id": "b3dcc932-4c2c-43dd-b2aa-7f3e7237acfa",
      "name": "LINE Webhook 觸發器",
      "webhookId": "line-ai-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        384,
        -48
      ],
      "id": "73b82d74-9d31-40e6-b3e4-62d99c026e15",
      "name": "即時回傳 200 OK"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 解析 LINE Webhook Payload\nconst body = $input.first().json.body;\nif (!body || !body.events || body.events.length === 0) {\n  return [];\n}\n\nconst event = body.events[0];\nconst userId = event.source?.userId || '';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    eventType: event.type,\n    replyToken: event.replyToken || '',\n    userId,\n    sessionId: userId,\n    messageType: event.message?.type || '',\n    userMessage: event.message?.text || ''\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        384,
        176
      ],
      "id": "93e69b74-67a8-47a1-860e-e08320de6767",
      "name": "解析 LINE 訊息事件"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-text-message",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.messageType }}",
              "rightValue": "text",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        624,
        176
      ],
      "id": "420f70bc-3b6a-4d81-a9c7-de2db797a8fa",
      "name": "是否為文字訊息？"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=LINE 使用者 ID：{{ $json.userId }}\n使用者問題：{{ $json.userMessage }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=你是一位專業、親切且高效的 LINE 官方客服智慧助理。請遵循以下規則：\n1. 必須一律使用「繁體中文（台灣習慣用語）」進行回覆。\n2. 語氣親切有禮，可適度使用 emoji 增加互動質感。\n3. 回答簡潔明瞭、重點突出，避免冗長無重點的文字。\n4. 若使用者提及先前的提問，請參考對話歷史記憶進行連貫回應。"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        864,
        176
      ],
      "id": "422eb60c-c94e-4b55-9045-837fcabba442",
      "name": "LINE AI 客服代理"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        384
      ],
      "id": "86ac95b2-b490-492a-822e-9ac5ad65089a",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "kZ6wOkA4NqZDTRQ0",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        960,
        384
      ],
      "id": "317e4515-9428-4d4d-a216-f72dfaa7e544",
      "name": "對話記憶 (依 User ID 隔離)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.line.me/v2/bot/message/reply",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"replyToken\": \"{{ $('解析 LINE 訊息事件').item.json.replyToken }}\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"text\": \"{{ $json.output }}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
